      "content": "KINGS LANGLEY          \tHIGH STREET TL 0702 \t\t\t\t\t(West side)                                        13/146                                  \tNos. 36, and 36A - GV                                     \t\tII Shop and flat over. Long rear wing c.1600, front range and short NW wing C18. Red brick with wooden mutular eaves cornice at front. Roughcast timber framed older rear wing. Steep old red tile roofs, hipped on front block and NW wing. 2 storeys. L-shaped C18 block facing E attached to older rear wing with outshut on its S side. Large square chimney at junction of front block and older wing. 2 front windows to 1st floor, twin recessed sash windows with 6/6 panes on LH (No.36A) over a moulded brick band and small shop window with door. RH part (No. 36) has a flush box sash window with rubbed brick flat arch and 6/6 panes over C19 shopfront. Listing NGR: TL0719002637"
    }
  ],
